# Audit level: only block on critical issues at install/CI time.
# The 3 high vulnerabilities currently flagged all originate in n8n-workflow's
# transitive lodash dep. They have no upstream fix yet (see README Roadmap) and
# are not reachable through this package's API surface.
# `npm audit` and `npm audit --omit=dev` both still print full details on demand.
audit-level=critical
